'''BC.Game Esports''' is an [[:category:United Arab Emirates|Emirati]] esports organization that is partnered with BC.Game Casino and owned by Kera Media.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2024
|name2=2025
|name3=2026
|This=3

|content1=
*June 25th - '''BC.Game Esports''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' with the signing of [[GuardiaN]] as coach. <ref name="+GuardiaN">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/39306/guardian-returns-as-coach-of-new-bcgame-team|title=GuardiaN returns as coach of new BC.Game team|date=2024-06-25|author=[[Striker (Czech journalist)|Striker]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
