*June 27th - '''BC.Game Esports''' sign [[joel]] and acquire [[CacaNito]] from [[Apeks]]. <ref name="+joel">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/BCGameEsports/status/1806341730695864750|title=We are blessed by his arrival!|date=2024-06-27|author='''BC.Game Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="+CacaNito">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/BCGameEsports/status/1806341721850089474|title=We bet he will impress you!|date=2024-06-27|author='''BC.Game Esports'''}}</ref>
