*August 15th - '''BC.Game Esports''' sign [[KWERTZZ]]. <ref name="+KWERTZZ">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bcgameesports/status/1824136811918114980|title=Today we welcome our new player, @kwt_cs, to the team!|date=2024-08-15|author='''BC.Game Esports'''}}</ref>
