*October 5th - '''BetBoom Team''' sign [[innersh1ne]] as coach and acquire [[Dart]] from [[9Pandas]] as team manager. <ref name="+innersh1ne +Dart">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/BetBoomTeam/status/1710002647858585676|title=News about CS roster expansion!|date=2023-10-05|author='''BetBoom Team'''}}</ref>

|content2=
*February 24th - '''BetBoom Team''' bench [[innersh1ne]]. <ref name="innersh1ne bench">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/BetBoomTeam/status/1761377892087328878|title=Coach of Betboom Team Slava «innersh1ne» Britvin leaving the CS 2 team|date=2024-02-24|author='''BetBoom Team'''}}</ref>
