*March 28th - [[danistzz]] is acquired by [[Team Space]]. <ref name="dani team space">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/BetBoomTeam/status/1773364509907837407|title=Danil «danistzz» Roslyakov is leaving our CS2 roster|date=2024-03-28|author='''BetBoom Team'''}}</ref>
*March 31st - '''BetBoom Team''' part ways with [[innersh1ne]]. <ref name="-innersh1ne">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/BetBoomTeam/status/1774062981371879609|title=Viacheslav «Innersh1ne» Britvin is leaving the BetBoom Team and as of April 1st, will become a free agent|date=2024-03-30|author='''BetBoom Team'''}}</ref>
*November 26th - '''BetBoom Team''' bench [[nafany]] and [[KaiR0N-]]. <ref name="nafany KaiR0N- bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/BetBoomTeam/status/1861314472003920149|title=Vladislav «nafany» Gorshkov and Alexander «KaiR0N-» Anashkin have been benched and placed on the transfer list|date=2024-11-26|author='''BetBoom Team'''}}</ref>

|content3=
