*August 9th - [[nafany]] and [[KaiR0N-]] are acquired by [[AMKAL ESPORTS]]. <ref name="-nafany -KaiR0N-">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/betboomteamcs2/819|title=Владислав «nafany» Горшков и Александр «KaiR0N-» Анашкин покидают BetBoom Team|trans_title=Vladislav “nafany” Gorshkov and Alexander “KaiR0N-” Anashkin are leaving BetBoom Team|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2025-08-09|author='''BetBoom Team'''}}</ref>

|content4=
*January 6th - '''BetBoom Team''' bench [[RAiLWAY]] and acquire [[Fierce]] from [[9Pandas]] as his replacement. <ref name="RAiLWAY bench">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/betboomteam/status/2008463838560035168|title=CS roster coach Artem “RAiLWAY” Gradovich moves to the inactive roster|date=2026-01-06|author='''BetBoom Team'''}}</ref><ref name="+fierce">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/BetBoomTeam/status/2008478854491361430|title=Artem “Fierce” Ivanov joins BetBoom Team as the new CS coach|date=2026-01-06|author='''BetBoom Team'''}}</ref>
*April 9th - '''BetBoom Team''' bench [[ArtFr0st]] and reinstate [[zorte]] to the starting lineup. <ref name="ArtFr0st bench">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/betboomteamcs2/2158|title=Мы выходим на финишную прямую перед Мажором, и я думаю, что будет честно поделиться с вами последними новостями нашего CS-ростера|trans_title=We're entering the final stretch before the Major, and I think it's only fair to share with you the latest news from our CS roster|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2026-04-09|author=[[Pioneer]]}}</ref>
*April 27th - '''BetBoom Team''' acquire [[FL4MUS]] on loan from [[Virtus.pro]]. <ref name="+FL4MUS loan">{{cite web|url=https://virtus.pro/news/fl4mus-joins-bb-team-on-loan|date=2026-04-27|title=FL4MUS joins BB Team on loan|publisher=[[Virtus.pro]]}}</ref>
*July 2nd - '''BetBoom Team''' part ways with [[FL4MUS]] upon the expiration of his loan. <ref name="-FL4MUS loan">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/fl4mus92/status/2072720989771661687|title=Hey everybody my loan deal with Betboom has come to an end and I’m back to Virtus Pro|date=2026-07-02|author=[[FL4MUS]]}}</ref>
*August 1st - [[Ax1Le]] and [[ArtFr0st]] are acquired by [[1w Team]], the latter on loan. <ref name="1w art ax1">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/BetBoomTeam/status/2083496139488195000|title=Sergey "Ax1Le" Rykhtorov is leaving the team and will continue his career with 1W|date=2026-08-01|author='''BetBoom Team'''}}</ref>
}}

